# Build context of Dockerfile and Dockerfile.test. Both images run `npm ci`
# themselves; a node_modules, build or .svelte-kit directory left over from a
# local build (possibly for another platform) must not be copied over it.
# tests/ and playwright.config.ts stay in: Dockerfile.test copies them.
node_modules
build
.svelte-kit
test-results
playwright-report
**/.env*
